    [
     1,
     "<p dir=\"ltr\">Dear Hima,</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Unfortunately chromosome M gives problems in the extraction step. Probably because of the lack of heterozygous positions.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">I should implement a cleaner way to handle this situation in future versions.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Could you try to select the chromosomes to sequenza.extract in the argument &quot;chromosome.list&quot;? You can pass a vector of the chromosome you would like to extract, eg: paste0(&quot; chr&quot;, c(1:22,&quot;X&quot;,&quot;Y&quot;).</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Best</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Francesco</p>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\">Il 07/dic/2015 02:35 PM, &quot;Hima Anbunathan&quot; &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">hn.bi...@gmail.com</a>&gt; ha scritto:<br type=\"attribution\"></div>"
