     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>Can you check that your GC file and the bam files you are using have the same chromosome order?</div><div><br></div><div>If not you may use a chromosome per chromosome approach.</div><div><br></div><div>Best</div><div><br></div><div>Francesco<br><div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div>"
